msgstr "I'll translate the Chinese text into English following your rules. However, you haven't provided the actual Chinese text to translate. Please provide the text you'd like me to translate."

msgid "CV 融合算子开发"
msgstr "Development of CV Fusion Operator"

msgid "CV 融合算子指同一个算子中同时使用 Cube Core 和 Vector Core：Cube Core 通常负责 `tl.dot`、矩阵乘或卷积式主计算，Vector Core 负责 bias、activation、softmax、归约、mask、layout 重排或跨块同步。CV 融合的目标是减少 kernel 边界和 GM 往返，但需要同时控制 Cube tile、Vector tile、UB/L1 占用和同步关系。"
msgstr "CV fusion operator refers to the simultaneous use of Cube Core and Vector Core within the same operator: Cube Core is typically responsible for `tl.dot`, matrix multiplication, or convolution-style main computation, while Vector Core handles bias, activation, softmax, reduction, mask, layout rearrangement, or cross-block synchronization. The goal of CV fusion is to reduce kernel boundaries and GM round trips, but it requires simultaneously controlling Cube tile, Vector tile, UB/L1 occupancy, and synchronization relationships."

msgid "CV 融合简单算子开发"
msgstr "Development of a Simple CV Fusion Operator"

msgid "简单 CV 融合建议先从本仓 [矩阵乘法样例](../examples/05_matrix_multiplication_example.md) 抽出稳定的 `tl.dot` 主计算，再在写回前加入 Vector 后处理；更复杂的切片更新可参考 [融合注意力样例](../examples/04_fused_attention_example.md)。最小路径如下："
msgstr "For simple CV fusion, it is recommended to first extract the stable `tl.dot` main computation from the [matrix multiplication example](../examples/05_matrix_multiplication_example.md) in this repository, and then add Vector post-processing before writing back; for more complex slice updates, refer to the [fused attention example](../examples/04_fused_attention_example.md). The minimal path is as follows:"

msgid "先实现稳定的 Cube 主计算，例如 `acc = tl.dot(a, b, acc)`。"
msgstr "First implement the stable Cube main computation, for example `acc = tl.dot(a, b, acc)`."

msgid "在 accumulator 写回前融合轻量 Vector 后处理，例如 bias、scale、activation 或 dtype cast。"
msgstr "Fuse lightweight Vector post-processing before accumulator write-back, such as bias, scale, activation, or dtype cast."

msgid "对较大的 accumulator，可使用 `range` 配合 `extension.extract_slice`/`extension.insert_slice` 做普通子块切分，避免 Vector 后处理阶段 UB overflow。"
msgstr "For larger accumulators, you can use `range` combined with `extension.extract_slice`/`extension.insert_slice` to perform ordinary sub-block slicing, avoiding UB overflow in the Vector post-processing stage."

msgid "`extension.parallel(..., bind_sub_block=True)` 属于更强的显式多 Vector 子块绑定路径，目标硬件和编译配置存在差异时可能不可用，不建议作为简单示例的默认写法。"
msgstr "`extension.parallel(..., bind_sub_block=True)` belongs to a stronger explicit multi-Vector sub-block binding path. It may not be available when the target hardware and compilation configurations differ, so it is not recommended as the default writing style for simple examples."

msgid "示例结构："
msgstr "Example structure:"

msgid "# Inside the matmul kernel, the fp32 accumulator is obtained after the K loop completes.\\n"
msgstr "Inside the matmul kernel, the fp32 accumulator is obtained after the K loop completes."

msgid "简单 CV 融合开发时要保持边界清晰：Cube 负责产生较大的二维 accumulator，Vector 负责同一 tile 内的逐元素或小规模归约。若 Vector 部分需要跨多个 Cube tile 共享状态，就需要引入同步、workspace 或拆分 kernel。"
msgstr "Keep boundaries clear during simple CV fusion development: Cube is responsible for producing larger two-dimensional accumulators, while Vector handles element-wise or small-scale reductions within the same tile. If the Vector portion needs to share state across multiple Cube tiles, synchronization, workspace, or kernel splitting must be introduced."

msgid "CV 融合复杂算子开发"
msgstr "Development of Complex Operators for CV Fusion"

msgid "复杂 CV 融合可参考 [Ascend/triton-ascend-ops](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-ascend-ops) 中的 best practice："
msgstr "For complex CV fusion, refer to the best practice in [Ascend/triton-ascend-ops](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-ascend-ops)."

msgid "[`tutorial/best_practice/002-decode_grouped_attention.py`](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-ascend-ops/blob/main/tutorial/best_practice/002-decode_grouped_attention.py)：Decode attention 中 QK/PV 使用 Cube，softmax、mask、指数、归一化和离散 KV 访存重排使用 Vector。"
msgstr "[`tutorial/best_practice/002-decode_grouped_attention.py`](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-ascend-ops/blob/main/tutorial/best_practice/002-decode_grouped_attention.py): In Decode attention, QK/PV uses Cube, while softmax, mask, exponent, normalization, and discrete KV memory access rearrangement use Vector."

msgid "[`tutorial/best_practice/003-fused-cat-slice-conv1d.zh.md`](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-ascend-ops/blob/main/tutorial/best_practice/003-fused-cat-slice-conv1d.zh.md)：展示融合 cat、slice、conv1d update 时如何用 `extension.insert_slice`、转置和分核优化减少离散访存与 padding 开销。"
msgstr "[`tutorial/best_practice/003-fused-cat-slice-conv1d.zh.md`](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-ascend-ops/blob/main/tutorial/best_practice/003-fused-cat-slice-conv1d.zh.md): Demonstrates how to use `extension.insert_slice`, transposition, and kernel splitting optimization to reduce scattered memory access and padding overhead when fusing cat, slice, and conv1d update operations."

msgid "复杂 CV 融合建议按数据流分层组织："
msgstr "Complex CV fusion is recommended to be organized in layers according to the data flow:"

msgid "**主计算层**：识别哪些步骤必须走 Cube，例如 QK、PV、GEMM、batched matmul。"
msgstr "**Main Computation Layer**: Identifies which steps must go through the Cube, such as QK, PV, GEMM, and batched matmul."

msgid "**Vector 后处理层**：识别 softmax、activation、mask、scale、normalization、cat/slice、layout transform 等是否能在同一 tile 内完成。"
msgstr "**Vector Post-processing Layer**: Identify whether operations such as softmax, activation, mask, scale, normalization, cat/slice, and layout transform can be completed within the same tile."

msgid "**访存重排层**：对离散 KV cache、MoE token 重排、短尾轴（最后一个维度） tensor，优先在 UB 中用 `extension.insert_slice`、`extension.extract_slice`、转置或借轴转置形成硬件友好的连续访问。"
msgstr "**Memory Access Reordering Layer**: For discrete KV cache, MoE token reordering, and short-tail axis (last dimension) tensors, prioritize using `extension.insert_slice`, `extension.extract_slice`, transpose, or axis-borrowing transpose in the UB to form hardware-friendly contiguous access."

msgid "**流水和同步层**：通过 `multibuffer`、`set_workspace_multibuffer`、`tile_mix_vector_loop`、`tile_mix_cube_loop` 等编译选项探索 Cube 与 Vector 的重叠执行。"
msgstr "**Pipeline and Synchronization Layer**: Explore the overlapping execution of Cube and Vector through compilation options such as `multibuffer`, `set_workspace_multibuffer`, `tile_mix_vector_loop`, and `tile_mix_cube_loop`."

msgid "**分核层**：CV 融合算子通常按 Cube Core 数量发射 grid；运行时会以约 1:2 的比例协同 Vector Core。不要简单沿用 GPU 上的大 grid。"
msgstr "**Core Distribution Layer**: CV fusion operators typically launch grids based on the number of Cube Cores; the runtime coordinates Vector Cores at a ratio of approximately 1:2. Do not simply reuse the large grid sizes from GPU."

msgid "对于 attention 类 CV 融合，推荐先让非 causal、短序列、小 head_dim 的 case 跑通，再逐步加入："
msgstr "For attention-based CV fusion, it is recommended to first get the non-causal, short-sequence, small head_dim cases working, then gradually add:"

msgid "causal mask 分阶段处理。"
msgstr "Causal mask is processed in stages."

msgid "长序列 K/V block 循环。"
msgstr "Long-sequence K/V block loop."

msgid "`m_i`/`l_i` 的数值稳定 softmax 更新。"
msgstr "Numerically stable softmax update for `m_i`/`l_i`."

msgid "HEAD_DIM 较大时的 accumulator workspace 和子块切分。"
msgstr "Accumulator workspace and sub-block partitioning when HEAD_DIM is large."

msgid "KV cache 离散索引下的 load 重排。"
msgstr "Load reordering under discrete indexing of KV cache."

msgid "复杂 CV 融合调优时，优先观察 profiling 中 Cube、Vector、MTE2 的时间占比。如果 Cube 等待 Vector，考虑减少 Vector 后处理粒度或打开 CV balance 相关选项；如果 Vector 等待搬运，优先检查离散访存、tail-axis padding 和 multibuffer 配置。"
msgstr "When tuning complex CV fusion, first observe the time proportions of Cube, Vector, and MTE2 in profiling. If Cube is waiting for Vector, consider reducing the Vector post-processing granularity or enabling CV balance-related options; if Vector is waiting for data movement, prioritize checking scattered memory access, tail-axis padding, and multibuffer configurations."
